VUE_APP_TITLE=Smart Control Panel : Project-Alice
VUE_APP_DESCRIPTION=The Xiaozhi Backend Service (Project-Alice-Server) is a backend service system for intelligent terminal hardware and software systems, led and developed by the team of Professor Liu Siyuan at South China University of Technology. Tailored specifically for the xiaozhi-esp32 open-source hardware, it features core capabilities such as multi-protocol compatibility, voiceprint recognition, and knowledge base management.
VUE_APP_KEYWORDS=xiaozhi-server, Xiaozhi server,Project-Alice-Server, Smart Control Panel, AI hardware, smart hardware, AI toys, emotional companionship, chatbot, smart home, in-vehicle robot